# The Cloud Functions lint config enforces LF line endings (eslint
# linebreak-style). On Windows checkouts git can hand these files back as CRLF,
# which fails `npm run lint` — and that lint is a firebase.json predeploy hook,
# so a CRLF checkout blocks `firebase deploy --only functions` entirely.
# Pin them to LF in the working tree so the hook stays deployable.
functions/**/*.js text eol=lf
functions/.eslintrc.js text eol=lf

# Rules files are deployed verbatim; keep them stable across platforms too.
firestore.rules text eol=lf
storage.rules   text eol=lf
